# Work-state continuity

Before implementing, lean always-on only:

- `task.md` Work Packet if present
- `ROADMAP.md` active phase / first unchecked item only
- `docs/agents/current-state.md` Active phase + What exists / gaps when unfamiliar or existence may have changed
- `git log -5 --oneline` + `git status`
- `AGENTS.md` / rules as pointer index (open linked docs only when needed)

Not always-on: full `CONTEXT.md`, `progress.md`, issue-tracker, archived ROADMAP, research notes.

Before a Checkpoint (git commit of in-progress work), update Work Packet SFDBN fields in `task.md`.

Portable delivery gate: `bash tests/verify.sh`.
